 "content": "<div id=\"content\" role=\"main\" class=\"content-area\">\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<section class=\"section\" id=\"section_1770169831\">\n\t\t<div class=\"section-bg fill\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<div class=\"section-content relative\">\n\t\t\t\n\n  <div class=\"banner has-hover bg-zoom\" id=\"banner-454093517\">\n          <div class=\"banner-inner fill\">\n        <div class=\"banner-bg fill\">\n            <img width=\"1366\" height=\"573\" src=\"https://ava-architects.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/hoat-dong-ava-architects-46.jpg\" class=\"bg attachment-original size-original\" alt=\"hoat dong ava architects 46\" title=\"Dịch vụ 1\">                        <div class=\"overlay\"></div>            \n                    </div>\n\t\t\n        <div class=\"banner-layers container\">\n            <div class=\"fill banner-link\"></div>            \n   <div id=\"text-box-1634597696\" class=\"text-box banner-layer x50 md-x50 lg-x50 y50 md-y50 lg-y50 res-text\">\n                                <div class=\"text-box-content text dark\">\n              \n              <div class=\"text-inner text-center\">\n                  \n<h3><span style=\"font-size: 140%;\">Human Design &amp; Build</span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 130%;\">Lấy con người làm trọng tâm, Kiến tạo giá trị bền vững </span></p>\n              </div>\n           </div>\n                            \n\n    </div>\n \n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n            \n\n  </div>\n\n\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\n\n\t</section>\n\t\n\n\t<section class=\"section\" id=\"section_1044778208\">\n\t\t<div class=\"section-bg fill\">\n\t\t\t<img width=\"736\" height=\"487\" src=\"https://ava-architects.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/nen-ava-arrchitects-01.jpg\" class=\"bg attachment-original size-original\" alt=\"nền ava architects\" title=\"Dịch vụ 2\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<div class=\"section-content relative\">\n\t\t\t\n<div class=\"row align-middle align-center\" id=\"row-1908251104\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-445586457\" class=\"col pb-0 medium-6 small-12 large-6\" data-animate=\"fadeInLeft\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n<div class=\"container section-title-container\"><h3 class=\"section-title section-title-normal\"><b></b><span class=\"section-title-main\">THIẾT KẾ trọn gói</span><b></b></h3></div>\n<p class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Tại AVA Architects, chúng tôi tin rằng một công trình hàng đầu không chỉ nằm ở sự tráng lệ bên ngoài mà còn ở khả năng đáp ứng nhu cầu và trải nghiệm của con người.</p>\n<p class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Vì vậy, trong mọi thiết kế, AVA luôn kết hợp sáng tạo, chất lượng và hiệu quả để tạo ra những giải pháp thiết kế tối ưu nhất. Từ đó, mang lại những giá trị độc nhất và bền vững vượt thời gian.</p>\n<a href=\"https://ava-architects.vn/lien-he/\" class=\"button primary is-outline lowercase\">\n\t\t<span>Xem chi tiết</span>\n\t<i class=\"icon-angle-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a>\n\n<div class=\"row row-small\" id=\"row-1795446217\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-216935726\" class=\"col small-12 large-12\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div class=\"img has-hover x md-x lg-x y md-y lg-y\" id=\"image_528524097\">\n\t\t<a class=\"image-lightbox lightbox-gallery\" title=\"\" href=\"https://ava-architects.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/vinhome-river-pearl-ha-noi-01.jpg\">\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-inner image-zoom dark\">\n\t\t\t<img width=\"1366\" height=\"839\" src=\"https://ava-architects.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/vinhome-river-pearl-ha-noi-01.jpg\" class=\"attachment-original size-original\" alt=\"Vinhome river peal hà nội\" title=\"Dịch vụ 3\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\t\t\n\n\t</div>\n\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n\n\t<div id=\"col-120220611\" class=\"col pb-0 medium-6 small-12 large-6\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div class=\"img has-hover x md-x lg-x y md-y lg-y\" id=\"image_1015759223\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-inner image-zoom dark\">\n\t\t\t<img width=\"985\" height=\"1182\" src=\"https://ava-architects.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Ngoai-that-Aries-Building-01-e1737208204392.jpg\" class=\"attachment-original size-original\" alt=\"ngoại thất aries building\" title=\"Dịch vụ 4\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t</div>\n\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\n\n\t</section>\n\t\n\n\t<section class=\"section dark\" id=\"section_1818303145\">\n\t\t<div class=\"section-bg fill\">\n\t\t\t<img width=\"2048\" height=\"1387\" src=\"https://ava-architects.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/nen-ava-arrchitects-02-1.jpg\" class=\"bg attachment- size-\" alt=\"nen ava arrchitects 02 1\" title=\"Dịch vụ 5\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<div class=\"section-content relative\">\n\t\t\t\n<div class=\"row\" id=\"row-1994899157\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-220700764\" class=\"col medium-5 small-12 large-5\" data-animate=\"fadeInLeft\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div class=\"img has-hover absolute-image x md-x lg-x y md-y lg-y\" id=\"image_1643597935\">\n\t\t<a class=\"image-lightbox lightbox-gallery\" title=\"\" href=\"https://ava-architects.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/ava-architects-build-04.jpg\">\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-inner image-zoom image-cover dark\" style=\"padding-top:75%;\">\n\t\t\t<img width=\"1365\" height=\"768\" src=\"https://ava-architects.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/ava-architects-build-04.jpg\" class=\"attachment-original size-original\" alt=\"đổ bô tông AVA Architects Xây dựng\" title=\"Dịch vụ 6\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\t\t\n\n\t</div>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"img has-hover absolute-image x md-x lg-x y md-y lg-y\" id=\"image_352945443\">\n\t\t<a class=\"image-lightbox lightbox-gallery\" title=\"\" href=\"https://ava-architects.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/ava-architects-build-01.jpg\">\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-inner image-zoom image-cover dark\" style=\"padding-top:75%;\">\n\t\t\t<img width=\"1366\" height=\"1025\" src=\"https://ava-architects.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/ava-architects-build-01.jpg\" class=\"attachment-original size-original\" alt=\"hoàn thành đổ bô tông AVA Architects Xây dựng\" title=\"Dịch vụ 7\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\t\t\n\n\t</div>\n\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n\n\t<div id=\"col-1850330978\" class=\"col medium-7 small-12 large-7\" data-animate=\"fadeInRight\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n<div class=\"container section-title-container\"><h3 class=\"section-title section-title-normal\"><b></b><span class=\"section-title-main\">Thi công xây dựng trọn gói</span><b></b></h3></div>\n<p class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">AVA Architects mang đến giải pháp thi công xây dựng chất lượng, tỉ mỉ trên từng chi tiết. Chọn AVA, bạn sẽ được trải nghiệm quy trình thi công chuyên nghiệp, đảm bảo tiến độ và sự chính xác cao nhất.</span></p>\n<p class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Với đội ngũ thi công lành nghề và tâm huyết, AVA cam kết kiến tạo những công trình vững chắc, vượt trội về chất lượng, mang đến không gian sống hoàn mỹ và bền vững.</span></p>\n<a href=\"https://ava-architects.vn/lien-he/\" class=\"button primary is-outline lowercase\">\n\t\t<span>Xem chi tiết</span>\n\t<i class=\"icon-angle-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a>\n\n<div class=\"row row-small\" id=\"row-1535979652\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-1331237283\" class=\"col medium-6 small-12 large-6\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div class=\"img has-hover x md-x lg-x y md-y lg-y\" id=\"image_1443159865\">\n\t\t<a class=\"image-lightbox lightbox-gallery\" title=\"\" href=\"https://ava-architects.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/ava-architects-build-02.jpg\">\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-inner image-zoom image-cover dark\" style=\"padding-top:124%;\">\n\t\t\t<img width=\"770\" height=\"768\" src=\"https://ava-architects.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/ava-architects-build-02.jpg\" class=\"attachment-original size-original\" alt=\"Cốt thép AVA Architects Xây dựng\" title=\"Dịch vụ 8\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\t\t\n\n\t</div>\n\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n\n\t<div id=\"col-691003624\" class=\"col medium-6 small-12 large-6\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div class=\"img has-hover x md-x lg-x y md-y lg-y\" id=\"image_1169781096\">\n\t\t<a class=\"image-lightbox lightbox-gallery\" title=\"\" href=\"https://ava-architects.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/ava-architects-build-03.jpg\">\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-inner image-zoom image-cover dark\" style=\"padding-top:124%;\">\n\t\t\t<img width=\"767\" height=\"582\" src=\"https://ava-architects.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/ava-architects-build-03.jpg\" class=\"attachment-original size-original\" alt=\"Hoạt động AVA Architects Xây dựng\" title=\"Dịch vụ 9\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\t\t\n\n\t</div>\n\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\n\n\t</section>\n\t\n\n\t<section class=\"section\" id=\"section_1132064373\">\n\t\t<div class=\"section-bg fill\">\n\t\t\t<img width=\"640\" height=\"480\" src=\"https://ava-architects.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/nen-ava-arrchitects-03.jpg\" class=\"bg attachment- size-\" alt=\"nen ava arrchitects 03\" title=\"Dịch vụ 10\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<div class=\"section-content relative\">\n\t\t\t\n<div class=\"row\" id=\"row-1631793320\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-1725639991\" class=\"col medium-5 small-12 large-5\" data-animate=\"fadeInLeft\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div class=\"img has-hover x md-x lg-x y md-y lg-y\" id=\"image_414279317\">\n\t\t<a class=\"image-lightbox lightbox-gallery\" title=\"\" href=\"https://ava-architects.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Watect-Building01.jpg\">\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-inner image-zoom image-cover dark\" style=\"padding-top:127%;\">\n\t\t\t<img width=\"880\" height=\"768\" src=\"https://ava-architects.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Watect-Building01.jpg\" class=\"attachment-original size-original\" alt=\"AVA Architects Thiết kế và Xây dựng\" title=\"Dịch vụ 11\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\t\t\n\n\t</div>\n\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n\n\t<div id=\"col-684422608\" class=\"col medium-7 small-12 large-7\" data-animate=\"fadeInRight\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n<div class=\"container section-title-container\"><h3 class=\"section-title section-title-normal\"><b></b><span class=\"section-title-main\">THIẾT KẾ &amp; thi công TRỌN GÓI</span><b></b></h3></div>\n<p class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"font-size: 100%;\">AVA Architects mang đến giải pháp kiến trúc đồng bộ. Lựa chọn giải pháp này bạn sẽ được trải nghiệm quy trình đồng bộ từ thiết kế đến thi công, giúp bạn tiết kiệm thời gian và chi phí một cách tối ưu.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 100%;\">Với sự tận tâm và chuyên nghiệp, AVA cam kết mang đến những thiết kế sáng tạo, độc đáo, đi kèm chất lượng thi công tỉ mỉ !</span></p>\n<a href=\"https://ava-architects.vn/lien-he/\" class=\"button primary is-outline lowercase\">\n\t\t<span>Xem chi tiết</span>\n\t<i class=\"icon-angle-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a>\n\n<div class=\"row row-small\" id=\"row-1469109518\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-901544812\" class=\"col medium-4 small-12 large-4\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div class=\"img has-hover x md-x lg-x y md-y lg-y\" id=\"image_2053979959\">\n\t\t<a class=\"image-lightbox lightbox-gallery\" title=\"\" href=\"https://ava-architects.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Noi-that-Watect-Building-01.jpg\">\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-inner image-zoom dark\">\n\t\t\t<img width=\"1366\" 